    ns1:P03_has_range_literal "This tool lets you to manually add markup to your documents. It can even learn from your supplied annotation and pre-annotate. Mind that the performance depends on data size and annotation complexity (e. g. the number of labels). However, it is a high-quality tool even without considering the pre-annotation option at all. " ;
