<https://clscor.io/entity/1077163b-2077-4906-b486-8d989e099b84> a ns1:PC0_Typed_CRM_Property,
        ns1:PC3_has_note,
        rdfs:Resource,
        owl:Thing ;
    ns1:P01_has_domain <https://clscor.io/entity/8083e23efc> ;
    ns1:P03_has_range_literal """Calc provides quick support to users when calculating basic statistical tasks most commonly encountered in corpus research. The GUI is divided into a number of modules reflecting specific research problems. Unlike other similar tools, Calc is task-based, which means that suitable statistical tests have already been pre-selected for a given task, so that users can draw statistically well-founded conclusions based on the input data.
The tool does not process a text. The input is typically numbers (frequencies) and the output is statistical significance, confidence intervals etc.""" ;
    ns1:P3.1_has_type ns2:tool_description ;
    owl:sameAs <https://clscor.io/entity/1077163b-2077-4906-b486-8d989e099b84> .

