    ns1:P01_has_domain <https://clscor.io/entity/5be8b0ff33> ;
    ns1:P03_has_range_literal """The PoetryLab API is a REST API that provides an analysis  endpoint to extract information about the poems. It can annotate Spanish poetry with rhyme, metric, enjambment, and part of speech.
Only the method POST is allowed at the /analysis endpoint. A playground interface documenting the API can be found at the /ui endpoint.""" ;
