    ns1:P03_has_range_literal """Arborator Grew is an interactive and user-friendly on-line tool for annotating treebanks. It provides annotation management over several users with different editing rights. It can also be used in the classroom. The teacher can provide correct solutions and make them visible for the students to a varying extent.  
