    ns1:P03_has_range_literal "Pérez Pozo, Á., de la Rosa, J., Ros, S., González-Blanco, E., Hernández, L., & de Sisto, M. (2022). A bridge too far for artificial intelligence?: Automatic classification of stanzas in Spanish poetry. Journal of the Association for Information Science and Technology, 73(2), 258–267. https://doi.org/10.1002/asi.24532" ;
