    ns1:P3_has_note """The tool is fully language independent: any Unicode script, any character collation.
Automatic linguistic annotations depend on NLP tools used or annotations imported from source.
For example, TreeTagger can lemmatize English, German, Italian, Spanish, Russian, Latin, Greek, Ancien Greek, Written Modern French, Spoken Modern French, Written Old French, Written Middle French, Written Early Modern French, etc. (see TreeTagger software description for all available languages)""" ;
    owl:sameAs <https://clscor.io/entity/663c5ea1-a633-4b23-b345-9c1c2354b9cc> .

