    ns1:P3_has_note "The drag-and-drop module converts from a number of different format, so that ideally no pre-structuring is necessary. But all internal files are TEI/XML. The whole tool is TEI/XML based, with minimal deviation from the standard to make it possible to edit and process/display, but all such deviation can be converted to standard TEI in the export." ;
