    ns1:P3_has_note "The input should ideally be in TEI/XML, but there are various conversion tools that convert from a collection of OCR, Spoken, and annotated formats. But all internal files are TEI/XML. The whole tool is TEI/XML based, with minimal deviation from the standard to make it possible to edit and process/display, but all such deviation can be converted to standard TEI in the export." ;
    owl:sameAs <https://clscor.io/entity/c224f12a-49d7-4514-bcb0-326ab43ba04a> .

